.SS "uint32_t(* schultz_selectable_vtable::length) (\fBschultz_tree\fP *tree, \fBschultz_handle\fP node)"
How many bytes of selectable text this node holds\&.
.PP
Zero means it is taking no part at the moment, which is how a label that has been told it is not selectable declines without the area needing to know what a label is\&. 
.PP
