.SS "void(* schultz_selectable_vtable::range) (\fBschultz_tree\fP *tree, \fBschultz_handle\fP node, uint32_t *out_low, uint32_t *out_high)"
What is selected here now, as the pair set_range was last given\&.
.PP
The mirror of set_range, and needed because a copy has to ask each node what its share turned out to be rather than working it out a second time and hoping the two agree\&.
.PP
Equal values mean nothing is selected here\&. 
